                    "copy": "©2021 Mighty Yell Studios Inc. ©2021 Skybound, LLC. Skybound and any related marks or logos are registered or otherwise protected trademarks owned by Skybound, LLC and/or its affiliates.",
                    "privacyPolicyLink": {
